WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.590
Install the eScoresheet from openvolley.app → "Download".

2
00:00:04.640 --> 00:00:07.918
The desktop app for Windows and Linux, the app for Android tablets.

3
00:00:07.968 --> 00:00:11.434
Windows may warn about a new app: "More info" → "Run anyway".

4
00:00:11.484 --> 00:00:14.564
Linux (APT) and Android (F-Droid) update by themselves.

5
00:00:14.614 --> 00:00:16.772
No install needed: the same app runs in the browser.

6
00:00:16.822 --> 00:00:20.448
Home links the desktop app: it scores without internet and serves the tablets in the hall.

7
00:00:20.498 --> 00:00:23.061
A new version: "Update available!"

8
00:00:23.111 --> 00:00:26.627
"Refresh to update" loads it. Between matches, not during one.

9
00:00:26.677 --> 00:00:31.028
The desktop app updates itself: "Update … is ready". It installs when you quit OpenVolley.
